    "detailed_description": "Description<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolo development and the first game of GameLife studio - GATARI: Sand on Teeth - casual slasher of knightly tournaments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet new weapons in battles with bosses on an open map, performing various tasks from the inhabitants of the game world GATARI.<br />\r\nThe battles on PVE in arenas will give you extra lives and give access to new characters. Earn game points and increase your world ranking, become the best player! The game GATARI will allow you to fight in PVP tournaments, hone your skills and become the best duel player!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecifications:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Choose your character type<br />\r\n\u2022 Character development<br />\r\n\u2022 Receiving Various Weapons<br />\r\n\u2022 Various bosses<br />\r\n\u2022 Restriction on revival<br />\r\n\u2022 Unlimited levels<br />\r\n\u00a0<br />\r\nEach level gives you a chance to get a new weapon or revival point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame development plans:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. Alfa - PVE arena battles.<br />\r\n2. Beta - Village Defense (Tower Defense mode)",
    "about_the_game": "Description<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolo development and the first game of GameLife studio - GATARI: Sand on Teeth - casual slasher of knightly tournaments.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet new weapons in battles with bosses on an open map, performing various tasks from the inhabitants of the game world GATARI.<br />\r\nThe battles on PVE in arenas will give you extra lives and give access to new characters. Earn game points and increase your world ranking, become the best player! The game GATARI will allow you to fight in PVP tournaments, hone your skills and become the best duel player!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecifications:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Choose your character type<br />\r\n\u2022 Character development<br />\r\n\u2022 Receiving Various Weapons<br />\r\n\u2022 Various bosses<br />\r\n\u2022 Restriction on revival<br />\r\n\u2022 Unlimited levels<br />\r\n\u00a0<br />\r\nEach level gives you a chance to get a new weapon or revival point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame development plans:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. Alfa - PVE arena battles.<br />\r\n2. Beta - Village Defense (Tower Defense mode)",
    "short_description": "GATARI: Sand on Teeth - casual slasher of knightly tournaments. Competition among players for the maximum passage of levels. Playing on the side of the Vikings or knights, boss fights. Become the best player in the world!",
